  "content": "\n\n<h1><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5971f50d-65dc-4ac7-9d83-c6ed5a109913.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"249\"></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">需要自訂的 Minecraft FPS 武器模型與動畫嗎？手槍、近戰武器、紋理、換彈動畫等，全部使用 Blockbench 製作。歡迎查看：</span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.fiverr.com%252fs%252f5rWozN3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.fiverr.com/s/5rWozN3</a></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkwork.com%252fanimation-3d%252f52100157%252fi-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench%253fref%253d24079144\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">https://kwork.com/animation-3d/52100157/i-will-make-custom-minecraft-fps-weapon-models-in-blockbench?ref=24079144</span></a></span></h3>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><br>❄️ Frostbound Protocol</span></h1>\n<p><strong>版本：</strong>1.5 | <strong>Minecraft：</strong>1.20+</p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">🌨 關於</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">踏入嚴酷的</span> <span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>Frostbound Protocol</strong></span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">世界，這是一款沉浸式的寒冷生存資料包。在探索雪地生物群系時，抵禦極端氣溫、暴風雪與刺骨寒風。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">🔥 特色</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🌡 <strong>溫度介面（HUD）</strong></span> &ndash;<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> 即時查看你的寒冷程度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">⛺&nbsp;<strong>出生點庇護所與物資</strong></span> &ndash; <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">初始提供基礎庇護所、營火與生存裝備。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\">❄&nbsp;<strong>隨機暴風雪</strong></span> &ndash; <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">暴風雪事件會觸發畫面震動、雪花粒子與音效。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">🐺&nbsp;<strong>沉浸式氛圍</strong></span> &ndash;<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> 積雪會逐漸堆積、狂風呼嘯，讓暴風雪體驗更加真實。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">🔥&nbsp;<strong>營火與熔爐暖氣</strong></span> &ndash; <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">保持體溫，延長生存時間。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">⚡ 使用方法</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">站在雪地生物群系中會逐漸累積寒冷值。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">使用營火或熔爐可降低寒冷值。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">HUD 會即時顯示你的體溫狀態。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">暴風雪事件會隨機發生；請尋找庇護所以倖存。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">如需重新生成初始庇護所，請使用&nbsp;<code>/function frostbound:spawn/shelter</code>。</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\">手動測試暴風雪：&nbsp;<code>/function frostbound:blizzard/start</code></span></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
